-- src:3193 | $700 plus disbursement
-- src:3194 | $700 plus disbursement
-- src:3195 | $600 plus disbursement
@ref O 21 app 1 para 3(3) (src:3192-3195)
GIVEN court IS A `o 21 app 1 court column`
GIVETH A `o 21 app 1 allowance`
`o 21 app 1 para 3(3) the costs for service out of Singapore` MEANS
    CONSIDER court
    WHEN `o 21 app 1 the High Court` THEN `o 21 app 1 a fixed sum plus disbursement` 700
    WHEN `o 21 app 1 a District Court` THEN `o 21 app 1 a fixed sum plus disbursement` 700
    WHEN `o 21 app 1 a Magistrate's Court` THEN `o 21 app 1 a fixed sum plus disbursement` 600

-- src:3192 | (3) Where service out of Singapore is ordered and effected
@ref O 21 app 1 para 3(3) (src:3192-3192)
