GIVEN item IS A `o 21 app 1 para 3(3) disbursement`
      `it was reasonably incurred in connection with the substituted service or the service out of Singapore` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE `o 21 app 1 allowance`
`o 21 app 1 para 3(3) the disbursement to be allowed` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF item EQUALS `o 21 app 1 para 3 another disbursement`
        THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): "are limited to disbursements reasonably incurred ... and are the following" lists seven items and no more
        IF NOT `it was reasonably incurred in connection with the substituted service or the service out of Singapore`
        THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (a sum cannot carry the no): the yes/no twin answers JUST FALSE where it was not reasonably incurred
        OTHERWISE CONSIDER item
