                  WHEN `o 21 app 1 para 3(3)(b) affirmation fees for affidavit in support of application` THEN JUST `o 21 app 1 the actual fees`
                  WHEN `o 21 app 1 para 3(3)(c) each attempted service` THEN JUST (`o 21 app 1 a fixed sum` 20)
                  WHEN `o 21 app 1 para 3(3)(d)(i) substituted service within Singapore by posting on the door` THEN JUST (`o 21 app 1 a fixed sum` 20)
                  WHEN `o 21 app 1 para 3(3)(d)(ii) substituted service within Singapore by advertisement` THEN JUST `o 21 app 1 the actual cost`
                  WHEN `o 21 app 1 para 3(3)(e) service out of Singapore` THEN JUST `o 21 app 1 the actual cost`
                  WHEN `o 21 app 1 para 3(3)(f) title searches` THEN JUST `o 21 app 1 the actual cost`
                  WHEN `o 21 app 1 para 3 another disbursement` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): see above

