-- src:3293 | ( e )
-- src:3294 | postage, photocopying, miscellaneous charges and incidentals
-- src:3295 | $50
-- src:3296 | $50
-- src:3297 | $50
@ref O 21 app 1 para 4 (src:3268-3297)
GIVEN item IS A `o 21 app 1 para 4 disbursement`
      `the case is one under paragraph 1(3) in Part 1 of this Appendix` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the item is applicable` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE `o 21 app 1 allowance`
`o 21 app 1 para 4 the disbursement to be allowed in addition to the items under Part 2` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT `the case is one under paragraph 1(3) in Part 1 of this Appendix`
        THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (a sum cannot carry the no): the yes/no twin answers JUST FALSE where the case is not under paragraph 1(3)
        IF item EQUALS `o 21 app 1 para 4 another disbursement`
        THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): paragraph 4 lists five disbursements and no more
        IF NOT `the item is applicable`
        THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "(if applicable)"
        OTHERWISE CONSIDER item
                  WHEN `o 21 app 1 para 4(a) court fees` THEN JUST `o 21 app 1 the actual fees`
                  WHEN `o 21 app 1 para 4(b) affirmation fees for supporting affidavit` THEN JUST `o 21 app 1 the actual fees`
                  WHEN `o 21 app 1 para 4(c) personal service of the originating claim in Singapore` THEN JUST (`o 21 app 1 a fixed sum` 20)
                  WHEN `o 21 app 1 para 4(d) each attempted service where there is no order for substituted service` THEN JUST (`o 21 app 1 a fixed sum` 20)
                  WHEN `o 21 app 1 para 4(e) postage, photocopying, miscellaneous charges and incidentals` THEN JUST (`o 21 app 1 a fixed sum` 50)
                  WHEN `o 21 app 1 para 4 another disbursement` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): see above

