        IF `the sum settled or awarded where the claimant succeeds, or claimed where the claimant fails` AT MOST 20000
        THEN JUST (`o 21 app 1 a range` 3000 6000)
        IF `the sum settled or awarded where the claimant succeeds, or claimed where the claimant fails` AT MOST 40000
        THEN JUST (`o 21 app 1 a range` 4000 12000)
        IF `the sum settled or awarded where the claimant succeeds, or claimed where the claimant fails` AT MOST 60000
        THEN JUST (`o 21 app 1 a range` 5000 18000)
        OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the table stops at "more than $40,000 to $60,000"

